<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Pre-Raid Best in Slot Gear list for Protection Paladin Tank in Wrath of the Lich King Classic for Phase 3. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from Heroics, reputation rewards, and the new 10-man Raid loot added to Titan Rune Dungeons.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot-gear">Protection Paladin Tank Best in Slot Gear, Gems, and Enchants - Pre-Raid Phase 3</h2>Frankly the only thing you need to do is maintain crit immunity through -5.6% crit suppression, this is obtained through either 540 defense skill, or a combination of resilience and defense. Mostly everything else is just window dressing, though even crit immunity is optional on entry-level raid encounters, so in reality just try to get as close to this value as possible while also maximizing your health pool for 10-man normal raid encounters.<br/>
<br/>Phase 3 introduces <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47241/emblem-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></a>, these are primarily awarded from <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4722/trial-of-the-crusader">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Trial of the Crusader</span></a>. However you can acquire up to 5 a day through Titan Rune Beta heroic dungeons and the daily heroic from <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=20735/archmage-landalock">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Archmage Lan'dalock</span></a>. <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=2589/sidereal-essence">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_icediamond_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sidereal Essence</span></span></a> also gets added, this currency is likewise obtainable at 1 per Titan Rune Beta dungeon, you use these to purchase 10-man Hardmode gear (239 &amp; 245 i-Level) gear, this lets you target farm some of the best items from phase 2 just through doing dungeons. All in all this means you can get some very strong gear, that will match entry level raiding gear in many respects.<br/>
<br/>While the amount of essence required to farm all of these items is daunting, we want to stress that it is by no means necessary to have this full set before engaging with larger group size content like raids, this is simply an illustrative article meant to showcase what you can build without raiding. Likewise tanking gear can be very flexible once you understand that matching the basic criteria of being uncrittable and having a respectable health pool means you can mix and match a lot of equipment, the items here are configured as a set and does not rule out other items that are potentially strong sidegrades or even in a vacuum upgrades on a slot per slot basis.<br/>
<br/>
