<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Blue Socket - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40119/solid-majestic-zircon">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_42.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Solid Majestic Zircon</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Yellow Socket - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40167/enduring-eye-of-zul">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_41.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enduring Eye of Zul</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40166/vivid-eye-of-zul">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_41.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vivid Eye of Zul</span></a></div></li></ul>Primarily try to match <span class="gem2">red</span> and <span class="gem4">yellow</span> sockets when the bonus matches/<wbr/>exceeds +6 stamina or when it is crucial to do so for crit immunity or hit cap reasons.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-enchants">Best Enchants for Protection Paladin Tank - Pre-Raid Phase 3</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Head - <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50369/arcanum-of-the-stalwart-protector">
