<div data-markup-content-target="1">Hands - <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=63770/reticulated-armor-webbing">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reticulated Armor Webbing</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Legs - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=38373/frosthide-leg-armor">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_armorkit_32.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Frosthide Leg Armor</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Feet - <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=55016/nitro-boosts">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nitro Boosts</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Main-Hand Weapon - <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=59619/enchant-weapon-accuracy">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Accuracy</span></a>/<wbr/>
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=64579/enchant-weapon-blood-draining">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_note_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Blood Draining</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Off-Hand Weapon - <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44936/titanium-plating">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shield_19.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Titanium Plating</span></a></div></li></ul>Main stand out enchants here are your chest, cloak, and shield defense enchants which may be used at any point to bridge your early gearing defense gaps. Chest and cloak both provide roughly the same value in stats to their alternative counterparts making these highly efficient and you do not lose anything by enchanting defense. Your shield should preferably stay enhanced with block value. Likewise you have weapon enchant alternatives, Accuracy provides you with a base of stats that are relatively hard to replace, though you should look to re-enchant your weapon if you ever exceed your hit cap by more than 10 rating. We recommend <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46348/formula-enchant-weapon-blood-draining">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulaepic_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Formula: Enchant Weapon - Blood Draining</span></a> and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=22559/formula-enchant-weapon-mongoose">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_note_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Formula: Enchant Weapon - Mongoose</span></a> at that point.</div>